# 基本図形編集のプロセスから仮身をウインドウの外へ運び、待たずに離す (design 11.3), for
# tools/ui_run.py. A copy of 画用紙 (mkbig fig) and of 基本文章編集 (mkbig doc) are linked into
# BTRON; the figure is opened with the process from its link, the text's link is copied to the
# tray in BTRON and pasted into the figure, and carried by the hand out of the window into BTRON,
# the button let go on the move that leaves the window. The process asks the desktop to carry it
# on as it hears the hand go out (DT_RQ_CARRY), which comes after the button went up: the desktop
# lets it go where the button went up (desktop: carry asked with the button let go already), so
# it is put in BTRON and leaves the figure, as when the hand is held there a while.
# Keys with Ctrl (01): C 06, V 19.
mkbig fig 30 4
figproc 1
linkbig 180 45
mkbig doc 5
linkbig 190 70
wait 300
logmark
dclick 190 52
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 800
click 50 14
wait 300
click 230 78
wait 300
key 06 01
wait 300
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
key 19 01
expectsince figure: pasted, 33 shapes 1 picked
wait 500
click 600 500
wait 300
logmark
move 360 196
down
move 300 196
move 150 200
move 50 190
up
expectsincein 10 figure: carried 基本文章編集 (0)
expectsince figure: deleted, 32 shapes
wait 500
